\newlabel{tab:rq3_effect}{{D.7}{121}{Scenario S1 against the baseline (final configuration of E4, replayed test period), mean over ten paired seeds with 95\,\% $t$-interval. Values of the model under the conditions of E4, not estimates for the terminal}{table.caption.61}{}}
\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {D.8}{\ignorespaces Robustness of S1 $\pm 2$ (Z5): each run against its own baseline, mean over ten paired seeds with 95\,\% $t$-interval. (a) execution time without load; (b) the service model sees one more truck whenever another truck is at the block; (c) arrivals compressed to intensity 1.2; (d) hour-of-week arrivals and training block shares; in (d) the affected visits are compared as groups, not per visit.}}{121}{table.caption.62}\protected@file@percent }
